  "note": "V006 remains the active ROM baseline. V007 was rejected as too busy and tile-heavy. V008 cleaned the center and reduced tile cost but was judged too symmetric/static. V009 restores asymmetry and directional energy; its native translation is unselected until safe-area review. No source or pixels are final; lettering, model sheet, audio and template promotion remain unapproved. V010 shifts the crystal current off-center while protecting the logo-safe field; translation and native review are pending. V011 protects the central wordmark area more strictly; native translation and ROM review are pending. V012 moves the upper-left crystal mass farther into the corner to clear the SGDK glyph area; native translation and ROM review are pending. V013 adds an independent crystalline inward-energy challenger; source only, native translation and user review pending. V014 widens the logo-safe negative space of V013; native translation and human review pending. V015 rebalances the border asymmetrically and reduces, but does not remove, the lower reflection; source only, native translation and human review pending."
